(9, 'DJI 2212 920KV Brushless Motor (2 Pieces CW &amp CCW)', 13, 'single', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'exclusive', 1, NULL, '0009', 'C128', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '1768188195_dji-2212-920kv-brushless-motor-2-pieces-cw-amp-ccw.webp', '<p><strong>DJI 2212 920KV Brushless Motor for Quadcopters (2 Pieces CW &amp; CCW)</strong></p>\r\n<p>The DJI 2212 920KV Brushless Motor is a high-performance motor designed for quadcopters and multirotors. Key features include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>KV(rpm/v): 920</li>\r\n<li>Max Power: 370W</li>\r\n<li>Max Thrust: 1200 grams</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 53 grams</li>\r\n<li>Shaft Diameter: 4mm</li>\r\n<li>Shaft Length: 49mm</li>\r\n<li>Recommended Propeller for 2S battery: 12x4.5</li>\r\n<li>Recommended Propeller for 4S battery: 10x4.5</li>\r\n<li>Battery: 2S-3S Li-Po</li>\r\n<li>ESC (A): FMT 30A (recommended)</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 13, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-06 05:09:51', '2026-01-12 03:23:15'),
